     <P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">全校教工：<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">     </SPAN>2016</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">年度事业单位考核工作已经开始，根据上级文件精神，结合我校实际，特制定本年度我校考核工作方案。请每位教工认真学习方案，认真总结考核，确保考核公正公平、名副其实，让考核工作真正成为营造“争先创优”的工作氛围、提升“凝心聚力”的师德风尚的有力手段。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体" lang=EN-US><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">                                     </SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">绍兴一中<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">                                      </SPAN>2016</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">年<SPAN lang=EN-US>12</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>23</SPAN>日<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体" lang=EN-US><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体" lang=EN-US><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">附件<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>：<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">         </SPAN><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"> </SPAN></SPAN>绍兴一中<SPAN lang=EN-US>2016</SPAN>年度教工考核工作方案</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">根据市教育局《关于组织开展<SPAN lang=EN-US>2016</SPAN>年度事业单位工作人员考核工作的通知》和市人社局《绍兴市人力资源和社会保障局关于组织开展<SPAN lang=EN-US>2016</SPAN>年度事业单位工作人员考核工作的通知》精神，结合我校实际，特制订本年度考核工作方案。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 28.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">一、指导思想</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">按照“师德为首，业绩优先，群众公认”的原则，把真正为学校教育、教学、管理、服务工作付出辛勤劳动、作出较大贡献并获得显著业绩的教工推荐出来，凝聚正能量，倡导新风尚，促进新发展。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 28.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">二、推优办法<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">在每位教工交流的基础上，由考核小组评选推荐与校办、教学处、德育处、课程处等处室推荐相结合产生优秀候选人，再由中层干部、学科主任对优秀候选人进行民意测评，最后由党政联席会议讨论决定最终获得考核优秀的教工名单。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 28.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">三、工作流程</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">每位教工下载《事业单位工作人员年度考核登记表》（见附件），并在<SPAN lang=EN-US>12</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>30</SPAN>日（周五）下午<SPAN lang=EN-US>17</SPAN>：<SPAN lang=EN-US>00</SPAN>前将填写好的考核表（以自己的姓名命名）上传到校园网<SPAN lang=EN-US>-</SPAN>校办<SPAN lang=EN-US>-</SPAN>“年度考核”公共文件夹各考核组文件夹内。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">校办打印表格，并于<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>日（周五）下午分给各考核组负责人。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>3.1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">月<SPAN lang=EN-US>9</SPAN>日（周一）中午开始，分组交流，要求每个教工都必须认真交流（见习期教师只交流，不考核），且交流时间不得少于<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>分钟。分组交流具体时间与地点由负责人确定，并通知联系领导参加，同时要求各组对照补充事项中的有关条件通过书面投票方式推荐优秀候选人（按<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">﹪</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">比例四舍五入推荐），确定合格人选、不合格人选，由组长于<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>12</SPAN>日（周四）下午<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>点前把结果上报校办，校办将会同教学处、德育处、课程处等有关部门对推荐名单进行审核。同时，教学处、德育处、课程处、年级组根据教工在教育教学方面的实际表现做好优秀候选人的处室<SPAN lang=EN-US>/</SPAN>年级推荐工作，并把名单报校办。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>4.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">学校组织中层干部、学科主任对优秀候选人进行民意测评，并把测评结果递交党政联席会议。最后由学校党政联席会议讨论决定考核结果，并由校办组织好反馈工作。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">四、补充事项</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">   </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">（一）符合下列条件的教工在同等条件下优先推荐成为优秀候选人：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
