<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>4.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt">重视学科教学研究，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">积极承担选修课课程开发与实施任务，或</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt">有教研成果在学科正规刊物公开发表或在省市评比中获市级一等以上奖项</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">的教师</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt">。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
